# N1's bench: every kind the level format gained in N1, one section each,
# left to right. A plate opens a gate (the ladder is where to miss a catch
# from). Two switches open one gate together, the second thrown at from on
# top of the first. A lift goes up a storey, and a geyser throws you a storey
# higher. An ant walks a hollow you pass through, and an eyeball holds the
# last stretch before the exit.
size 16
height 360
[map]
